    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/lanternwp/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "LanternWP is a free WooCommerce theme for an online store of any kind. It is a WooCommerce block theme made for full site editing: store owners get a complete, fast e-commerce storefront and change it themselves in the Site Editor, with no page builder and no code. Its templates cover the home page, shop and categories, product page, cart, checkout, order confirmation and My account. The header brings a mega menu, product search and a mini-cart; the catalog has product filters and sorting; the product page has a product gallery, variations, reviews and a sticky Add to cart bar. Colors, fonts and spacing are in Styles, with style variations to start from, and block patterns build the home page and the store's content pages. Responsive, accessible and translation-ready. Appearance → LanternWP guides the setup. The store pictured is a demo: the demo import of complete stores comes with the free LanternWP Companion plugin and needs WooCommerce. Demos and docs: https://lanternwp.com"
    },
